            f"• Volume: <b>{volume}%</b>\n"
            f"• Unit price: <b>{unit_price} Xu / word</b>\n"
            f"• Estimate: <b>{raw_price} Xu</b>\n"
            f"• Total payment: <b>{total} Xu</b>\n\n"
