        f"✅ <b>Đã lưu asset #{asset_id} cho job #{job_id}</b>\n"
        f"• Type: <code>{html.escape(asset_type)}</code>\n"
        f"• URL: <code>{html.escape(url or '-')}</code>\n"
        f"• File ID: <code>{html.escape(file_id or '-')}</code>\n"
